  "body": "To download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/P12H\r\n\r\nIf easy living and being able to walk almost everywhere are high on your list, this one is hard to beat.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned at the sought-after northern end of Orewa, this north-facing, single-level brick and tile home delivers what so many buyers are looking for: low-maintenance living, a secure setting and an exceptional location just moments from the beach.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find three double bedrooms, including a generous master with ensuite, two bathrooms and spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living. The living flows out to a private, sunny courtyard surrounded by established nikau palms and easy-care grounds, giving you outdoor space to enjoy without spending your weekends maintaining it.\r\n\r\nA single internal access garage plus off-street parking adds to the ease and security. And if you forget the milk, don't worry, the local community dairy is just two doors down.\r\n\r\nBest of all is the location. Orewa Beach is less than 150 metres away on a flat walk, with easy beach access via nearby Puriri Avenue or Noel Avenue.\r\n\r\nYou can also wander down to Kohu Street and join the newly completed 600m Orewa beachfront shared pathway through to Marine View. Whether it's a morning walk, bike ride or simply heading down to the beach, it's a fantastic addition to an already incredibly walkable location.\r\n\r\nOrewa township is less than 900 metres away on a flat walk, putting cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities within easy reach.\r\n\r\nSingle level, secure, low maintenance and close to the beach. This is easy Orewa living at its best.",
